id: pm-u5c27w
title: "GH-866: telemetry flush queue-drain contract reports partial progress as fully drained"
description: "The telemetry flush SDK/CLI result sets queue_drained when the queue count merely decreases, even if entries remain. Publish unambiguous progress, empty, and drained-count facts while preserving an explicit compatibility contract."
