author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Flush results expose queue_progressed, queue_empty, and queue_entries_drained with precise types; queue_drained is true only when the queue is empty or is explicitly preserved under documented compatibility semantics; SDK, CLI, docs, and acceptance tests cover partial and complete drains; The GitHub report is linked to this canonical PM item"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Telemetry closeout evidence states exactly what happened
value: Automation cannot mistake partial delivery for an empty queue
impact: "Improves operational truth across SDK, CLI, and release closeout"
outcome: Telemetry flush receipts distinguish progress from completion
